1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,940
A Mother’s Day Surprise
母亲节的惊喜

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:08,900
The twins were filled with excitement as they thought of the surprise they were planning for Mother’s Day.
双胞胎想到他们正在为母亲节筹划的惊喜，满心兴奋。

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:13,490
How pleased and proud Mother would be when they brought her breakfast in bed!
等他们把早餐端到床前，妈妈该有多高兴、多自豪啊！

4
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,890
They planned to make French toast and chicken porridge.
他们打算做法式吐司和鸡肉粥。

5
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:19,510
They had watched their mother in the kitchen.
他们以前在厨房里看过妈妈怎么做。

6
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,540
There was nothing to it.
这根本没什么难的。

7
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:24,470
Jenna and Jeff knew exactly what to do.
珍娜和杰夫很清楚该怎么做。

8
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:26,720
The big day came at last.
盼望已久的日子终于到了。

9
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,120
The alarm rang at 6 a.m.
早上六点闹钟响了。

10
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,440
The pair went down the stairs quietly to the kitchen.
两人轻手轻脚地下楼，走进厨房。

11
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:35,140
They decided to boil the porridge first.
他们决定先煮粥。

12
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:40,660
They put some rice into a pot of water and left it to boil while they made the French toast.
他们往一锅水里放了些米，让它煮着，自己去做法式吐司。

13
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:44,710
Jeff broke two eggs into a plate and added in some milk.
杰夫往盘子里磕了两个鸡蛋，又加了些牛奶。

14
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:48,790
Jenna found the bread and put two slices into the egg mixture.
珍娜找来面包，把两片放进蛋液里。

15
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:53,540
Next, Jeff turned on the second stove burner to heat up the frying pan.
接着，杰夫打开第二个灶眼，把煎锅烧热。

16
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:57,860
Everything was going smoothly until Jeff started frying the bread.
一切都很顺利，直到杰夫开始煎面包。

17
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:02,060
The pan was too hot and the bread turned black within seconds.
锅太烫了，面包几秒钟就变黑了。

18
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:06,760
Jenna threw the burnt piece into the sink and put in the other slice of bread.
珍娜把烧焦的那片扔进水槽，又放进另一片面包。

19
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:10,820
This time, she turned down the fire so it cooked nicely.
这一次，她把火调小，面包煎得恰到好处。

20
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:15,620
Then Jeff noticed steam shooting out of the pot and the lid starting to shake.
这时杰夫发现，锅里直往外冒蒸汽，锅盖也开始抖动起来。

21
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:19,810
The next minute, the porridge boiled over and put out the fire.
转眼间，粥溢了出来，把火浇灭了。

22
00:01:20,610 --> 00:01:21,550
Jenna panicked.
珍娜慌了。

23
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:25,500
Thankfully, Jeff stayed calm and turned off the gas quickly.
幸好杰夫保持冷静，迅速关掉了煤气。

24
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:27,770
But the stove was a mess now.
可灶台现在一片狼藉。

25
00:01:28,570 --> 00:01:32,890
Jenna told Jeff to clean it up so they could continue to cook the rest of the porridge.
珍娜让杰夫把它清理干净，好接着把剩下的粥煮完。

26
00:01:33,690 --> 00:01:37,050
But Jeff’s hand touched the hot burner and he gave a cry of pain.
可杰夫的手碰到了滚烫的灶眼，他痛得叫了一声。

27
00:01:37,850 --> 00:01:40,200
Jenna made him put his hand in cold water.
珍娜让他把手放进冷水里。

28
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,690
Then she caught the smell of burning.
接着她闻到了一股焦味。

29
00:01:43,490 --> 00:01:44,140
Oh dear!
天哪！

30
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:47,660
The piece of bread in the pan had turned black as well.
锅里那片面包也煎黑了。

31
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:52,300
As the twins looked around them in disappointment, their father appeared.
双胞胎正失望地环顾四周，爸爸出现了。

32
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:56,540
The twins carried the breakfast upstairs and woke their mother up.
双胞胎把早餐端上楼，叫醒了妈妈。
